### Definition des marks en fonction de C 
#scalaire mu 1
#scalaire alpha_ij 1
#scalaire pi 0


## Definition du terme source de pi - mecanisme de marquage 
#scalaire "Fpi" alpha_ij*C-mu*pi


## Marks for conspecifics - dpidt
#tfmassegenscal                 tfmarksC                                      [champgeo, C, C, averaged_pi, schema_intg]

## Memory of previous encounters with conspecifics  - dkidt
#tfmassegenscal                 tfmemoryC                                     [champgeo, C, C, averaged_ki, schema_intg]


